questions.text:
A school stores olympiad results in the table **Result**. This PHP code loads them into a 2D array:

```php
$res = mysqli_query($conn, "SELECT Name, Grade, Score FROM Result ORDER BY Score DESC");
$rows = [];
while ($row = mysqli_fetch_row($res)) {
    $rows[] = $row;
}
```

The query returns these records:

| Name | Grade | Score |
|---|---|---|
| Dana | 11 | 92 |
| Saule | 11 | 85 |
| Arman | 12 | 81 |
| Yerlan | 11 | 70 |
| Kamila | 12 | 64 |

scheme.model_answer:
```php
<?php
$total = 0;
$count = 0;
for ($r = 0; $r < count($rows); $r++) {
    if ($rows[$r][1] == 11) {
        $total = $total + $rows[$r][2];
        $count++;
    }
}
if ($count > 0) echo round($total / $count, 2);
else echo "No grade 11 results";
?>
```

